ags</b> Railway, Ride, rumbling, Speed, Train, Train Ride, Transportation</dd>\n<dd><b>Type</b> Single Subject, Natural</dd>\n<dd><b>PDSounds record number</b> 283</dd>\n<dd><b>Comment</b> A 4 minute ride on a train from one station to the next. Use good headphones, close your eyes, and it feels like you're moving - This sound has great impact on me. It's like i feel the ground vibrating in my feet beneath me although i just sit in a room with headphones on.</dd></dl>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2007-05-27","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://www.pdsounds.org/audio/download/283/train_complete_ride_between_two_stations.mp3\">http://www.pdsounds.org/audio/download/283/train_complete_ride_between_two_stations.mp3</a>\n</p>\n<ul><li>PDSounds description: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://www.pdsounds.org/sounds/complete_train_ride_4_minutes\">http://www.pdsounds.org/sounds/complete_train_ride_4_minutes</a></li>\n<li>Transferred by <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:F%C3%A6\" title=\"User:F\u00e6\">F\u00e6</a></li></ul>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"stephan","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Permission":{"value":"<table class=\"layouttemplate sourcetemplate\" style=\"width:100%; clear:both; text-align:center; margin:0.5em auto; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0; border-spacing: 8px; background-color: var(--background-color-neutral-subtle, #f6f7f5); color: var(--color-base, #202122); border: var(--border-subtle, 1px solid #555555);\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding-top:10px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pdsounds.org-logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d1/Pdsounds.org-logo.png/120px-Pdsounds.org-logo.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumb